{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2022-12-01 12:36:00', 'title': 'HII DELIVERS DESTROYER LENAH SUTCLIFFE HIGBEE (DDG 123) TO U S. NAVY', 'text': "PASCAGOULA, MISS., DEC. 01, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HII'S (NYSE: HII) INGALLS SHIPBUILDING DIVISION DELIVERED THE\xa0ARLEIGH BURKE-CLASS GUIDED MISSILE DESTROYER\xa0LENAH SUTCLIFFE HIGBEE (DDG 123) TO THE U.S. NAVY TODAY. DELIVERY OF DDG 123 REPRESENTS THE OFFICIAL TRANSFER OF THE SHIP FROM THE SHIPBUILDER TO THE NAVY."}